msgid "结构"
msgstr "Structures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/structure.md:3
#: ffbc8c98dadf4974bba964e7312a4eb3
#
msgid ""
"与卡片 UI 的“结构”分组一致。这些卡片负责随机排布、层状复制和逐原子结构分组： `随机原子堆积` "
"在输入晶胞中重新随机放置全部原子，`分层堆叠` 复制完整层状结构， `原子层分组` 沿晶面法向识别原子层并写入逐原子 A/B 标签。"
msgstr ""
"This section matches the `Structures` group in the card picker. These "
"cards handle random placement, layer-wise replication, and per-atom "
"structural grouping: `Random Packing` randomly relocates all atoms within"
" the input cell, `Layer Stack` replicates a complete layered structure, "
"and `Layer Groups` identifies atomic layers along a plane normal and "
"writes per-atom A/B labels."
